    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="page-title">Shipping Policy</h1>

      <p>
        At StudyUpIndia, we are committed to delivering your books and
        educational materials in the most reliable and efficient way. Please
        read our shipping policy to understand how orders are processed and
        shipped.
      </p>

      <h2>1. Shipping Coverage</h2>
      <p>
        We currently offer shipping across most pin codes in India. If your
        location is not serviceable, our team will inform you during the order
        confirmation process.
      </p>

      <h2>2. Order Processing</h2>
      <p>
        Orders are typically processed within 1-3 business days after payment
        confirmation. Customized or bulk orders may take additional processing
        time, which will be communicated individually.
      </p>

      <h2>3. Estimated Delivery Time</h2>
      <p>
        Standard delivery time is between <strong>5-10 business days</strong>,
        depending on your location and availability of the books. For remote or
        non-metro areas, delivery may take slightly longer.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Delivery Partners</h2>
      <p>
        We work with trusted courier partners such as India Post, Delhivery,
        Blue Dart, and DTDC. Once your order is shipped, you will receive
        tracking details via email or SMS.
      </p>

      <h2>5. Delivery Charges & Handling Fee</h2>
      <p>
        Shipping charges may vary depending on the order size, weight, and
        delivery location. Any applicable shipping charges will be shown during
        checkout.
      </p>
      <p>
        Additionally, a small <strong>handling fee</strong> may be applicable on
        certain orders to cover packaging, logistics, and operational costs.
        This will also be transparently displayed during checkout.
      </p>

      <h2>6. Delays</h2>
      <p>
        While we strive to ensure timely deliveries, delays may occasionally
        occur due to unforeseen circumstances such as weather, strikes, or
        supply chain issues. We will do our best to keep you informed of any
        delay.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Order Tracking</h2>
      <p>
        Once your order is shipped, you can track it through the link shared
        with your registered email/SMS. If you face any issues, feel free to
        contact us for assistance.
      </p>

      <h2>8. Address Accuracy</h2>
      <p>
        Please make sure your shipping address and contact details are accurate
        and complete. We are not responsible for delayed or failed deliveries
        caused by incorrect address information.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>For any shipping-related queries or assistance, contact us at:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          Email:
          <a href="mailto:studyupindia1@gmail.com">studyupindia1@gmail.com</a>
        </li>
        <li>Phone: +91 9868505044</li>
      </ul>
